#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret raray anjeun anu Ubuntu Hello dibandingkeun. Tetep sahenteuna dua, "
"dirékam dina cahaya béda."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Némbongkeun modél anu disimpen pikeun:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Ngan hiji modél rupa anu didaptarkeun. Cahya robih kumaha raray anjeun "
"katingali ka kaméra, janten modél tunggal tiasa gagal dina soré handapeun "
"lampu (atanapi dina terangan). Tambihkeun modél kadua anu dirékam dina lampu "
"anu béda pikeun tetep muka konci anu dipercaya iraha waé dina sapoe."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambahkeun model kadua"

