#: src/main.ui:435
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Bewara desktop nembongkeun bari Ubuntu Hello néangan beungeut anjeun, teras "
"ngalaporkeun hasilna. Usaha anu gagal tetep dina daptar béwara."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Témbongkeun béwara"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Hiji kartu per usaha raray-auténtikasi, diropéa di tempat kalawan hasilna."

#: src/main.ui:503
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sora béwara"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Maén sora sistem pikeun dipikawanoh atawa gagal usaha ."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Kaasup diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkeun model, kapastian vs bangbarung, pigura, kaméra jeung timing ka "
"unggal kartu. Mangpaat nalika ngalaporkeun masalah."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis-Buka Konci"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktipkeun auténtikasi raray pikeun otomatis muka konci ring keyring anjeun "
"atanapi KWallet on login. Ieu sacara aman nyimpen kecap akses anjeun anu "
"disegel dina TPM upami sayogi, atanapi énkripsi nganggo AES-256-GCM nganggo "
"konci master wungkul. Set auth raray PAM_AUTHTOK pikeun pam_gnome_keyring "
"atawa pam_kwallet5 gumantung kana desktop Anjeun."

